<title>USA: Calif sets $3 bln RANs sale for August 13--advisor.</title>
<headline>Calif sets $3 bln RANs sale for August 13--advisor.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>California plans to tap the short-term, tax-exempt municipal market with a $3 billion sale of revenue anticipation notes on August 13, the state's financial advisor said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>An official with Public Resources Advisory Group added that the precise time of day that the notes, which will be sold competitively, would be priced has yet to be determined.</p>
<p>((--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650))</p>
